@startuml 09-sequence-account-service
title account-service - Diagrama de secuencia

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Cliente / Empleado\n(Postman)" as User
participant "AccountController\n(adaptador WebFlux)" as Controller
participant "AccountApplicationService\n(casos de uso, RxJava 3)" as Service
participant "AccountCreationPolicyFactory /\nAccountOperationRuleFactory" as Factory
participant "AccountRepositoryPort\n+ adaptador R2DBC" as Repo
participant "CustomerGateway\n+ WebClientCustomerGateway" as CustomerGw
participant "MovementGateway\n+ WebClientMovementGateway" as MovementGw
database "PostgreSQL\naccount_db" as DB
participant "customer-service" as CustomerSvc
participant "transaction-service" as TransactionSvc
participant "CorrelationIdWebFilter\n(WebFilter, prioridad máxima)" as Correlation

note over Controller, MovementGw
  Los casos de uso y puertos usan RxJava 3.
  WebFlux conserva Mono/Flux; los controladores convierten
  explícitamente con RxJava3Adapter. Los adaptadores R2DBC y
  WebClient convierten sus publishers Reactor a tipos RxJava en el límite.
  Las políticas de dominio son síncronas.
end note

note over User, Correlation
  Todas las solicitudes entrantes pasan por este filtro. Reutiliza
  X-Correlation-ID si no está vacío; si falta o está en blanco, genera un UUID.
  Todas las respuestas incluyen X-Correlation-ID: {id}. El controlador pasa
  el ID explícitamente a los casos de uso y los WebClient salientes lo envían
  en X-Correlation-ID.
end note

== 1. Abrir cuenta (POST /api/v1/accounts) ==
User -> Controller : POST /api/v1/accounts\nAccountCreateRequest
Controller -> Service : create(command): Single<Account>
loop cada holder de la solicitud
  Service -> CustomerGw : findById(holderId, correlationId): Maybe<CustomerSnapshot>
  CustomerGw -> CustomerSvc : GET /api/v1/customers/{customerId}\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
  CustomerSvc --> CustomerGw : 200 Customer\n(customerType, status)\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
  CustomerGw --> Service : monoToMaybe(...): Maybe<CustomerSnapshot>
end
alt customer-service responde 404
  CustomerSvc --> CustomerGw : 404 Not Found\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
  CustomerGw --> Service : CustomerNotFoundException
  Service --> Controller : Single.error(...)
  Controller --> User : 404 Not Found
else titulares activos y válidos
  Service -> Service : validar tipo homogéneo,\nestado ACTIVE y reglas de apertura
  opt titular PERSONAL y tipo distinto de FIXED_TERM
    Service -> Repo : findAll(customerId, accountType, 0, 100): Flowable<Account>
    Repo -> DB : SELECT cuentas del titular y tipo
    DB --> Repo : cuentas existentes
    Repo --> Service : fluxToFlowable(...): Flowable<Account>
  end
  Service -> Factory : get(customerType).validate(...)
  Factory --> Service : validación síncrona\n(o excepción de regla)
  alt política o campos de producto no válidos
    Service --> Controller : BusinessRuleViolationException
    Controller --> User : 422 Unprocessable Entity
  else política válida
    Service -> Repo : save(cuenta con saldo inicial 0): Single<Account>
    Repo -> DB : INSERT cuenta
    Repo -> DB : INSERT relaciones de titulares y firmantes\n(en la misma transacción)
    DB --> Repo : cuenta y relaciones guardadas
    Repo --> Service : monoToSingle(...): Single<Account>
    Service --> Controller : Single<Account>
    Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.singleToMono(...)
    Controller --> User : 201 Created + Location\nAccount
  end
end
note over Service, Factory
  Personal: una SAVINGS, una CHECKING y cualquier cantidad de FIXED_TERM;
  exactamente un titular. Business: solo CHECKING, uno o más titulares
  y firmantes autorizados opcionales. Toda cuenta inicia en cero.
end note
note over Controller, User
  Respuestas del contrato: 201, 400, 404, 422 y 503.
  400 corresponde a una solicitud inválida; 503, a un servicio dependiente.
end note

== 2. Listar cuentas (GET /api/v1/accounts) ==
User -> Controller : GET /api/v1/accounts\n?customerId&accountType&page&size
Controller -> Service : findAll(filter, page, size): Flowable<Account>
Service -> Repo : findAll(filter, page, size): Flowable<Account>
Repo -> DB : SELECT filtros; ORDER BY createdAt, id\nLIMIT/OFFSET + cargar relaciones
DB --> Repo : cuentas y relaciones
Repo --> Service : fluxToFlowable(...): Flowable<Account>
Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.flowableToFlux(...)
Controller --> User : 200 OK\napplication/json (arreglo) o application/x-ndjson
note over Controller, User
  Parámetros inválidos: 400 Bad Request.
end note

== 3. Consultar cuenta (GET /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}) ==
User -> Controller : GET /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}
Controller -> Service : findById(accountId): Single<Account>
Service -> Repo : findById(accountId): Maybe<Account>
Repo -> DB : SELECT cuenta y relaciones
DB --> Repo : fila o vacío
alt no existe
  Repo --> Service : monoToMaybe(...): Maybe.empty()
  Service --> Controller : AccountNotFoundException
  Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.singleToMono(...)\npropaga el error
  Controller --> User : 404 Not Found
else existe
  Repo --> Service : monoToMaybe(...): Maybe<Account>
  Service --> Controller : Single<Account>
  Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.singleToMono(...)
  Controller --> User : 200 OK + Account
end

== 4. Actualizar cuenta (PUT /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}) ==
User -> Controller : PUT /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}\nAccountUpdateRequest
Controller -> Service : update(accountId, command): Single<Account>
Service -> Repo : findById(accountId): Maybe<Account>
Repo -> DB : SELECT cuenta y relaciones
DB --> Repo : cuenta actual
Repo --> Service : Maybe<Account>
loop cada titular nuevo
  Service -> CustomerGw : findById(holderId, correlationId): Maybe<CustomerSnapshot>
  CustomerGw -> CustomerSvc : GET /api/v1/customers/{customerId}\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
  CustomerSvc --> CustomerGw : Customer activo\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
  CustomerGw --> Service : monoToMaybe(...): Maybe<CustomerSnapshot>
end
opt titular PERSONAL y cuenta distinta de FIXED_TERM
  Service -> Repo : findAll(customerId, accountType, 0, 100): Flowable<Account>
  Repo -> DB : SELECT productos personales del tipo
  DB --> Repo : cuentas existentes
  Repo --> Service : Flowable<Account>
end
Service -> Service : validar titulares, política y campos\n(no cambiar tipo ni saldo)
Service -> Repo : save(cuenta actualizada): Single<Account>
Repo -> DB : UPDATE cuenta + reemplazar relaciones\n(con control de versión)
alt error de regla o titular inactivo
  Service --> Controller : BusinessRuleViolationException
  Controller --> User : 422 Unprocessable Entity
else conflicto de versión
  Repo --> Service : ConcurrentModificationException
  Controller --> User : 409 Conflict
else guardado
  DB --> Repo : cuenta y relaciones actualizadas
  Repo --> Service : Single<Account>
  Service --> Controller : Single<Account>
  Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.singleToMono(...)
  Controller --> User : 200 OK + Account
end
note over User, Controller
  Respuestas del contrato: 200, 400, 404, 409, 422 y 503.
  Titular no encontrado: 404; solicitud inválida: 400;
  falla de servicio dependiente: 503.
end note

== 5. Eliminar cuenta (DELETE /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}) ==
User -> Controller : DELETE /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}
Controller -> Service : delete(accountId): Completable
Service -> Repo : findById(accountId): Maybe<Account>
Repo -> DB : SELECT cuenta y relaciones
alt no existe
  Service --> Controller : AccountNotFoundException
  Controller --> User : 404 Not Found
else existe
  Service -> Repo : delete(account): Completable
  Repo -> DB : DELETE relaciones de titulares y firmantes;\nDELETE cuenta (misma transacción)
  DB --> Repo : OK
  Repo --> Service : monoToCompletable(...): Completable
  Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.completableToMono(...)
  Controller --> User : 204 No Content
end

== 6. Consultar saldo (GET /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}/balance) ==
User -> Controller : GET /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}/balance
Controller -> Service : findById(accountId): Single<Account>
Service -> Repo : findById(accountId): Maybe<Account>
Repo -> DB : SELECT cuenta
alt no existe
  Service --> Controller : AccountNotFoundException
  Controller --> User : 404 Not Found
else existe
  Repo --> Service : Maybe<Account>
  Service --> Controller : Single<Account>
  Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.singleToMono(...)
  Controller --> User : 200 OK + Balance\n(productType=BANK_ACCOUNT)
end

== 7. Depositar (POST /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}/deposits) ==
User -> Controller : POST /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}/deposits\nOperationRequest
Controller -> Service : operate(accountId, DEPOSIT, command): Single<MovementReceipt>
Service -> Repo : findById(accountId): Maybe<Account>
Repo -> DB : SELECT cuenta y version
alt cuenta inexistente
  Service --> Controller : AccountNotFoundException
  Controller --> User : 404 Not Found
else cuenta existente
  DB --> Repo : cuenta original
  Repo --> Service : Maybe<Account>
  Service -> Factory : get(accountType).validate(DEPOSIT, ...)
  alt regla incumplida
    Factory --> Service : BusinessRuleViolationException
    Controller --> User : 422 Unprocessable Entity
  else regla válida
    Factory --> Service : validación síncrona
    Service -> Repo : save(account.registerMovement(DEPOSIT, ...)): Single<Account>
    Repo -> DB : UPDATE saldo y movimientos del mes\ncon control optimista de versión
    alt versión desactualizada
      Repo --> Service : ConcurrentModificationException
      Controller --> User : 409 Conflict
    else saldo actualizado
      DB --> Repo : cuenta guardada
      Repo --> Service : Single<Account> actualizado
      Service -> MovementGw : register(cuenta, DEPOSIT, ..., correlationId): Single<MovementReceipt>
      MovementGw -> TransactionSvc : POST /api/v1/movements\nMovementRequest\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
      alt movimiento registrado
        TransactionSvc --> MovementGw : 201 Created + Movement\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
        MovementGw --> Service : monoToSingle(...): Single<MovementReceipt>
        Service --> Controller : Single<MovementReceipt>
        Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.singleToMono(...)
        Controller --> User : 201 Created + MovementReceipt
      else fallo confirmado (respuesta 4xx)
        TransactionSvc --> MovementGw : error definitivo\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
        MovementGw --> Service : DownstreamServiceException no ambiguo
        Service -> Repo : save(estado original con versión actual)
        Repo -> DB : UPDATE compensatorio con control de versión
        DB --> Repo : compensación confirmada
        Controller --> User : 503 Service Unavailable
      else timeout, transporte o respuesta 5xx
        MovementGw --> Service : error ambiguo\n(movimiento posiblemente persistido)
        note right of Service
          No compensar. Requiere reconciliar
          el resultado del movimiento.
        end note
        Controller --> User : 503 Service Unavailable
      end
    end
  end
end
note over Controller, User
  Solicitud inválida: 400 Bad Request.
end note

== 8. Retirar (POST /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}/withdrawals) ==
User -> Controller : POST /api/v1/accounts/{accountId}/withdrawals\nOperationRequest
Controller -> Service : operate(accountId, WITHDRAWAL, command): Single<MovementReceipt>
Service -> Repo : findById(accountId): Maybe<Account>
Repo -> DB : SELECT cuenta y version
alt cuenta inexistente
  Service --> Controller : AccountNotFoundException
  Controller --> User : 404 Not Found
else cuenta existente
  DB --> Repo : cuenta original
  Repo --> Service : Maybe<Account>
  Service -> Factory : get(accountType).validate(WITHDRAWAL, ...)\ny validar saldo suficiente
  alt regla o saldo incumplidos
    Factory --> Service : BusinessRuleViolationException
    Controller --> User : 422 Unprocessable Entity
  else operación válida
    Service -> Repo : save(account.registerMovement(WITHDRAWAL, ...)): Single<Account>
    Repo -> DB : UPDATE saldo y movimientos del mes\ncon control optimista de versión
    alt versión desactualizada
      Repo --> Service : ConcurrentModificationException
      Controller --> User : 409 Conflict
    else saldo actualizado
      DB --> Repo : cuenta guardada
      Repo --> Service : Single<Account> actualizado
      Service -> MovementGw : register(cuenta, WITHDRAWAL, ..., correlationId): Single<MovementReceipt>
      MovementGw -> TransactionSvc : POST /api/v1/movements\nMovementRequest\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
      alt movimiento registrado
        TransactionSvc --> MovementGw : 201 Created + Movement\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
        MovementGw --> Service : Single<MovementReceipt>
        Service --> Controller : Single<MovementReceipt>
        Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.singleToMono(...)
       Controller --> User : 201 Created + MovementReceipt
      else error confirmado al registrar movimiento
        TransactionSvc --> MovementGw : error definitivo\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
        MovementGw --> Service : error definitivo no ambiguo\n(X-Correlation-ID: {id})
        Service -> Repo : restaurar saldo original
        Repo -> DB : UPDATE compensatorio con control optimista
        Controller --> User : 503 Service Unavailable
      else resultado remoto ambiguo (timeout, transporte o 5xx)
        note over Service, MovementGw
          No restaurar automáticamente; el movimiento podría existir.
          Requiere reconciliación.
        end note
        Controller --> User : 503 Service Unavailable
      end
    end
  end
end
note over Controller, User
  Solicitud inválida: 400 Bad Request.
end note

@enduml
